---
description: Apply tasteskill (design-taste-frontend) when designing or polishing this site
globs: index.html, styles.css, fonts/**, images/**
alwaysApply: false
---

This repo is configured to use the **design-taste-frontend** skill (tasteskill v2 from TasteCode).

When the user asks to design, redesign, polish, or de-slop the Grain & Gable site, read and follow:

1. Global install (preferred): `~/.agents/skills/design-taste-frontend/SKILL.md`
2. Project install (if present): `.agents/skills/design-taste-frontend/SKILL.md`

If neither path exists, restore from the repo pin:

```bash
npx skills experimental_install -y
```

The pin is recorded in `skills-lock.json` at the repository root.
